summary:
  A step pressed while a list is being written is lost: the list for the place before it is opened.

history:
  Every press moves the wish and only the last one is opened. A list
  takes a few milliseconds to be put in place, and a press in that time used
  to be answered with the place of the press before.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TimeshiftEngine.qml

find:
              if (_wantMs !== _planWant) {
                  _askFolder();
                  return true;
              }
              at = _plan;

replace:
              if (false) {
                  _askFolder();
                  return true;
              }
              at = _plan;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_slideengine.qml::test_a_press_while_the_list_is_written_starts_over.
